.joblib files of random forest regression (ensemble models) created with scikit-learn (v1.3.0)
'ParitySet' .csv files contain actual versus predicted 'PA14_Biomass' and 'DM_cpd01206_c' (pyocyanin synthesis) fluxes for the hold-out FBA training data. File name denotes their ensemble presence
'GammaXX' corresponds to the value of the upper biomass flux threshold for the objective decision tree during FBA simulation (see Figure 4 in manuscript)
'Gamma02_GlucArgMet_WT.joblib' was prepared for random forest regression evaluation (see Figure S.6 in manuscript), but was not used for GEM-CM simulations.
